{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09174","headline":"送云阳邹儒立少府侍奉还京师 · 韦应物","name":"送云阳邹儒立少府侍奉还京师","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"建中即藩守，天宝爲侍臣。\n历观两都士，多阅诸侯人。\n邹生乃後来，英俊亦罕伦。\n爲文颇瓌丽，禀度自贞醇。\n甲科推令名，延阁播芳尘。\n再命趋王畿，请告奉慈亲。\n一锺信荣禄，可以展欢欣。\n昆弟俱时秀，长衢当自伸。\n聊从郡阁暇，美此时景新。\n方将极娱宴，已复及离晨。\n省署慙再入，江海绵十春。\n今日阊门路，握手子归秦。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09174.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09174","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}